OL,3,GNEWSAMan's shock at flight abroad using
OL,4,Awife's passport
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who mistakenly travelled to Spain
OL,7,Fusing his wife's passport has said he
OL,8,Fis still baffled about how he was able
OL,9,Fto make the journey without being
OL,10,Fstopped.
OL,12,FBen Moore from Talke, Staffordshire,
OL,13,Fnoticed there was a problem soon after
OL,14,Fdisembarking his Ryanair flight while
OL,15,Fhe was queuing to get his passport
OL,16,Fchecked at Alicante airport.
OL,18,F"I opened up the passport there and, to
OL,19,Fmy horror, it was my wife's photo on
OL,20,Fthe passport," he said. "The lads who I
OL,21,Fwas with basically said the colour
OL,22,Fdrained out of me immediately."
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
