OL,3,GNEWSAMan's shock at flight abroad using
OL,4,Awife's passport
OL,5,
OL,6,FRyanair said checks at Manchester
OL,7,FAirport, where Moore flew from, were
OL,8,Fcarried out by a third-party handling
OL,9,Fprovider and that it was reviewing the
OL,10,Fmatter.
